IQ-TREE 2.4.0

SEQUENCE ALIGNMENT
------------------

Input data: 4 taxa with 2 partitions and 6 total sites (0% missing data)

  ID	Type	Seq	Site	Unique	Infor	Invar	Const	Name
   1	DNA	4	3	3	1	1	1	alpha_sites
   2	DNA	4	3	3	1	1	1	beta-block

SUBSTITUTION PROCESS
--------------------

Edge-linked-proportional partition model with separate substitution models and separate rates across sites

  ID  Model           Speed  Parameters
   1  GTR+F+R2        2.0    -
   2  HKY+F+R2        0.5    -
